<title>POLAND: Bank Gdanski Q4 net jumps to PLN 31.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Bank Gdanski Q4 net jumps to PLN 31.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Gdanski SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			46.71  vs   18.28</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  46.70  vs   18.28</p>
<p>    net profit				31.62  vs    7.58</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Gdanski SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	     0.01  vs    0.01</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    195.00  vs  184.82</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	 108.79  vs  107.66</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	    23.63  vs   17.12</p>
<p>    costs of commission		    9.13  vs    1.37</p>
<p>    income tax				15.08  vs   10.71</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.01  vs    0.00</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit		     165.06  vs  174.19</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 165.07  vs  173.89</p>
<p>    net profit			     101.21  vs   90.90</p>
